WEBVTT

00:55.902 --> 00:56.683
Why you?

01:34.177 --> 01:35.278
No! No! No!

02:29.074 --> 02:31.415
I don't know what to do.

02:55.261 --> 02:57.005
Why you?

03:29.482 --> 03:30.102
Shh. Shh.

04:03.928 --> 04:04.229
Oh,

04:28.377 --> 04:32.103
Who are you?

04:58.132 --> 04:59.333
Walking.

05:07.062 --> 05:09.865
Walking. Walking.

05:34.032 --> 05:34.654
No!

